laurel (Mi A3, Adreno 610): cap maxMemoryAllocationSize and maxBufferSize (so Metal's maxBufferLength) at the kernel's
largest contiguous buffer, RedwoodGPU property RedwoodMaxBuffer (patch 2850); TU_DARWIN_MAX_BO overrides. No property = no cap.
Applied after userland/turnip/mesa-patches by scripts/gpu/turnip-build.sh (TU_EXTRA_PATCHES, set by scripts/laurel/metal-build.sh).

